# Daily sweep scratch files. These three paths are overwritten by every run,
# so tracking them would rewrite the same diff daily and keep no usable
# history. The day's result is kept instead as seed/sweeps/<date>.json, which
# accumulates; the benchmarks it was read from are in seed/detail-pages/.
raw.json
listings.json
enriched.json
